  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sub Dialogue 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Now that the NETWORK FACTORY is placed, it is time we feed it some RESOURCES!
  - Each factory floor has an IMPORT building, which can be identified by its big
    white arrow on its roof. This building generates the starting items that each
    factory needs.
  - "By connecting conveyor belts to the IMPORT building, you can bring the items
    it generates to other buildings on the factory floor.\t"
  - If you ever lose the resources generated by the IMPORT building, you can click
    on the building to open its info panel. Here you can see some information about
    the building. Pressing the 'Generate' button will restart the IMPORT building.
  - Try to connect the IMPORT building to the NETWORK FACTORY you placed by using
    conveyor belts.
